{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"huangli-e-o154","title":"张嶷诛李求承","accounts":[{"id":"huangli-a-0333eddeac98c6add1ca","label":"正文","text":"张嶷诛李求承","evidence":["huangli-q-faeecbea0e29d618941a","huangli-q2-a057f1c163ad78d1eeac"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houzhu-p0028","role":"求募捕得李求承，数其宿恶而诛之","evidence":["huangli-q-faeecbea0e29d618941a"]},{"person":"huangli-p0017","role":"（斯都）〔邛都〕耆帅，昔手杀龚禄，被诛","evidence":["huangli-q-faeecbea0e29d618941a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huangli-q-faeecbea0e29d618941a"]},"ordering_evidence":"huangli-q-faeecbea0e29d618941a","source_order":[43,220,108],"order":7687}],"persons":[{"id":"houzhu-p0028","name":"张嶷","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"huangli-p0017","name":"李求承","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huangli-q-faeecbea0e29d618941a","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-50c976d911cb3286a22c","layer":"original","quote":"又（斯都）〔邛都〕耆帅李求承〖8〗，昔手杀龚禄；嶷求募捕得，数其宿恶而诛之","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":108,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q2-a057f1c163ad78d1eeac","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-50c976d911cb3286a22c","layer":"original","quote":"苏祁邑君冬逢、逢弟隗渠等〖6〗，已降复反。嶷诛逢。逢妻，旄牛王女〖7〗，嶷以计原之。而渠逃入西徼，渠刚猛捷悍，为诸种深所畏惮；遣所亲二人诈降嶷，实取消息。嶷觉之，许以重赏，使为反间；二人遂合谋，杀渠。渠死，诸种皆安。又（斯都）〔邛都〕耆帅李求承〖8〗，昔手杀龚禄；嶷求募捕得，数其宿恶而诛之。始，嶷以郡郛宇颓坏〖9〗，更筑小坞。在官三年，徙还故郡〖10〗；缮治城郭，夷种男女莫不致力。","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":192,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
